<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 16.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 16.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 16     Sept 13	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.860     240.940     237,040    1.61 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.550     301.500     303.640   -0.69 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.330     159.320     165.490   -3.72 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.740	46.662	48.410   -3.61 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  373.820     374.880     366.280    2.06 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.180     142.170     147.886   -3.86 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.772	15.773	14.975    5.32 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.240     218.520     230.135   -5.17 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.891	 1.888	 1.939   -2.48 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.560	 1.558	 1.575   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  193.875     194.580     206.030   -5.90 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
